 "song": {
  "duration": 176,
  "lines": [
   {
    "start": 12.186,
    "end": 15.088,
    "text": "我叫张子明　洪都城里的千户",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 1"
   },
   {
    "start": 15.341,
    "end": 17.84,
    "text": "一三六三年　城被围得太久",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 1"
   },
   {
    "start": 18.372,
    "end": 20.878,
    "text": "里外断了信　都督点了我的名",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 1"
   },
   {
    "start": 21.357,
    "end": 24.19,
    "text": "一条打鱼的小船　从水关底下走",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 1"
   },
   {
    "start": 24.929,
    "end": 27.481,
    "text": "夜里赶路　天一亮就躲起来",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 1"
   },
   {
    "start": 27.703,
    "end": 31.224,
    "text": "走了半个月　才看见应天的城楼",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 1"
   },
   {
    "start": 31.206,
    "end": 33.651,
    "text": "主上问我　对面的兵怎么样",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 1"
   },
   {
    "start": 33.985,
    "end": 36.994,
    "text": "我说江水在退　他的大船难航",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 1"
   },
   {
    "start": 37.679,
    "end": 41.701,
    "text": "主上说　回去告诉都督",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Pre-Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 41.653,
    "end": 43.519,
    "text": "坚守一个月　我亲自来打",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Pre-Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 45.752,
    "end": 48.324,
    "text": "城上的人　守住啊",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 48.911,
    "end": 51.418,
    "text": "救兵就要到　救兵就要到",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 52.974,
    "end": 56.365,
    "text": "守住啊　救兵就要到",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 59.411,
    "end": 61.975,
    "text": "我把这句话　揣在怀里往回赶",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 2"
   },
   {
    "start": 62.301,
    "end": 64.38,
    "text": "走到湖口　被汉兵拿下",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 2"
   },
   {
    "start": 65.096,
    "end": 67.317,
    "text": "他们说　去城下喊开城门",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 2"
   },
   {
    "start": 67.536,
    "end": 69.277,
    "text": "不死　还有富贵拿",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 2"
   },
   {
    "start": 70.966,
    "end": 72.853,
    "text": "我点了点头　说好",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 2"
   },
   {
    "start": 74.217,
    "end": 77.461,
    "text": "他们押着我　一步一步往城下",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 2"
   },
   {
    "start": 78.487,
    "end": 83.953,
    "text": "我站在城墙底下　抬起头",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Pre-Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 84.536,
    "end": 87.049,
    "text": "城上的人　守住啊",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 87.728,
    "end": 90.323,
    "text": "救兵就要到　救兵就要到",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 91.801,
    "end": 95.395,
    "text": "守住啊　救兵就要到",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 110.338,
    "end": 113.653,
    "text": "我喊我是张大舍　已经见过主上",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 3"
   },
   {
    "start": 113.967,
    "end": 117.044,
    "text": "城上的人听见了　守得更牢",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 3"
   },
   {
    "start": 117.223,
    "end": 119.919,
    "text": "身后的长槊　一起落下来",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 3"
   },
   {
    "start": 120.304,
    "end": 122.927,
    "text": "我的话　已经送到",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Verse 3"
   },
   {
    "start": 123.969,
    "end": 126.977,
    "text": "后来南昌城里　立了一座庙",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Bridge"
   },
   {
    "start": 127.335,
    "end": 129.478,
    "text": "十四尊像　我排在第八",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Bridge"
   },
   {
    "start": 129.934,
    "end": 133.894,
    "text": "又追封了我一个侯　叫忠节",
    "chorus": false,
    "tag": "Bridge"
   },
   {
    "start": 137.435,
    "end": 139.769,
    "text": "守住了　守了八十五天",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Final Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 140.294,
    "end": 142.682,
    "text": "七月救兵到了　我没有看到",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Final Chorus"
   },
   {
    "start": 143.413,
    "end": 148.919,
    "text": "我喊过的那一句　救兵就要到",
    "chorus": true,
    "tag": "Final Chorus"
   }
  ],
